  "description": "Regolis City, a lunar metropolis where full-brain digitization has become commonplace. Detective Sid Blake accepts a case and infiltrates a private presentation hosted by KainTech, only to witness KainTech’s new android, “Primer,” massacre every attendee. The only survivors are Sid and Lin. The two evade KainTech, which is attempting to cover up the incident, and set out to track down the mysterious android Primer to uncover its true purpose.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
